node_modules
dist
.audit
*.log
.DS_Store
.pstack-staging
.pstack-backup
# Build output of scripts/build-runtime.ts; `pstack/` is the committed copy.
#
# The directory is `.build/runtime`, not a top-level `runtime`. The old name collided
# with `scripts/runtime/`, which holds tracked sources, so a bare `runtime` rule would
# have ignored those too and a fresh clone could not run the build at all. Keeping the
# output under `.build/` removes the collision instead of warning about it.
/.build
# Upstream sources staged with RUNTIME_SOURCE_PATCHES applied, then bundled.
.runtime-sources
# Scratch space for local verification; never part of the package.
.tmp
